@startuml

title Fixing observations at system level, party fixings at party level

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "System level" {
    component "Fixing sources\npublished through their\npublishers' adapters" as sources
    database "Fixing observations\none per definition and fixing date,\ncorrected by new versions" as observations
    actor "Super administrator" as admin
}

package "Party level: each party that holds trades" {
    component "Fixings manager\nthe party's fixings: required,\ndormant, unofficial, official" as manager
    actor "Party operations" as ops
    component "Product services\nthe party's trades" as products
}

sources --> observations : publish
admin ..> observations : views every observation\nacross every source (read only)
manager --> observations : reads the observations\nits trades require
ops --> manager : authorise, override, undo
manager --> products : fix and undo events
products --> manager : the fixing schedules\nof the party's trades

note bottom of observations
    no authorisation and no override:
    an observation is the source's value
end note

note bottom of manager
    a party with no trades that fix
    has no fixings to manage
end note

@enduml
